id: debilitated
name: Debilitated
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Internal Assault names it in quotes and gives it its own rules. A mark, so it shows on the
# sheet; what it does is Internal Assault's (chat.mjs debilitate*).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Internal Assault's: Life Points off each Maneuver used, no Combat Recovery, Impediment and Staggered.
text: >
  Debilitated: "A Debilitated Opponent loses Life Points equal to ¼ (rounded up) of your Magic Modifier each time they
  use a Maneuver, cannot use the Combat Recovery Maneuver, and suffers from the Impediment and Staggered Combat
  Conditions."
